<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Steel Dynamics prices in range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Steel Dynamics prices in range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Steel Dynamics Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At			     $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $15-17</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		    9.84 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Morgan Stanley</p>
<p>NOTE: The Butler, Ind.-based company said in a statement that of the 9,843,750 shares being offered, 9,375,000 shares are being sold by the company and 468,750 shares are being sold by existing shareholders.</p>
<p>Steel Dynamics owns and operates a flat-rolled steel mini-mill which commenced operations in January 1996. ---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
